# LF in the repository and the working tree, whatever core.autocrlf says (it is true system-wide on
# this laptop). A mvnw checked out with CRLF fails inside a Linux container.
* text=auto eol=lf
mvnw text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Binary: never converted
*.jar binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
